                "id": "pk-p1",
                "text": "Our Retatrutide pen kit is our bestselling research compound kit — a complete Reta pen set combining a 40mg Retatrutide vial with a calibrated micro pin injector pen, 12× 32G micro needles, and alcohol wipes. Designed for structured GLP-1/GIP/glucagon receptor pathway research, the Retatrutide pen kit removes the need to source components separately and is ready to use straight from the box."
