            {
                "id": "pk-p2",
                "text": "ResearchChem.uk offers three peptide pen kit configurations: the Retatrutide 40mg Pen Kit (Reta pen), the Wolverine 20mg Pen Kit combining BPC-157 and TB-500 for tissue repair studies, and the GLOW GHK-CU 70mg Pen Kit for copper peptide research. All peptide pens include a filled vial, micro pin injector pen, 12× 32G micro pins, and 12× alcohol wipes — everything needed for a complete research protocol."
            },
