                "id": "pk-p3",
                "text": "All pen kits are dispatched from the UK within 2–3 working days. Multi-kit volume pricing is available at checkout. These kits are supplied strictly for qualified researchers conducting in-vitro laboratory research. Not for human or veterinary use."
